{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":24.360000610351562,"text":"A long garment in wool, woven in one piece, with no seams down the sides. That is how ancient clothes were made, too. They did not cut cloth into shapes. They wove it to its final size and wrapped it around the body with pins and a belt. Go close and look at the weave at the edge. You can see where the weaver changed color. And you can see it was done by hand, because the lines are not perfectly straight.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.46000000834465027},{"word":"long","start":0.46000000834465027,"end":0.800000011920929},{"word":"garment","start":0.800000011920929,"end":1.1399999856948853},{"word":"in","start":1.1399999856948853,"end":1.8799999952316284},{"word":"wool","start":1.8799999952316284,"end":1.8799999952316284},{"word":"woven","start":2.299999952316284,"end":2.3399999141693115},{"word":"in","start":2.3399999141693115,"end":2.640000104904175},{"word":"one","start":2.640000104904175,"end":2.859999895095825},{"word":"piece","start":2.859999895095825,"end":3.200000047683716},{"word":"with","start":3.5399999618530273,"end":3.740000009536743},{"word":"no","start":3.740000009536743,"end":4.079999923706055},{"word":"seams","start":4.079999923706055,"end":4.340000152587891},{"word":"down","start":4.340000152587891,"end":4.579999923706055},{"word":"the","start":4.579999923706055,"end":5.099999904632568},{"word":"sides","start":5.099999904632568,"end":5.099999904632568},{"word":"That","start":5.699999809265137,"end":5.880000114440918},{"word":"is","start":5.880000114440918,"end":6.059999942779541},{"word":"how","start":6.059999942779541,"end":6.28000020980835},{"word":"ancient","start":6.28000020980835,"end":6.659999847412109},{"word":"clothes","start":6.659999847412109,"end":6.960000038146973},{"word":"were","start":6.960000038146973,"end":7.239999771118164},{"word":"made","start":7.239999771118164,"end":7.400000095367432},{"word":"too","start":7.519999980926514,"end":7.71999979